\ Parameters nobody annotated, narrowed from the program's own call sites. The
\ freeze trace names each one it proved.
\
\ fib's `n` is proved from the two `30 fib` sites. fib-step's three parameters
\ come from `0 1 <rot- fib-step`, which the pass resolves by stepping into
\ `<rot-`'s prelude body, and hold up against the recursive call that passes
\ `b`, `a+b`, and `n-1`. Typing that arithmetic is what the locked build buys:
\ `+` promotes to bignum on overflow, but compiled arithmetic bails instead,
\ and a locked build rejects the per-op native fallback that is the only other
\ way a promoted value could reach compiled code.
\
\ The `[ swap over + ]` quotation is narrowed too, through the `dip` that
\ invokes it, so it reports under its emitted C symbol rather than a word name.

fib-step: ( a b n -- result ) [
  dup 0 = [ drop drop ] [
    1 - [ swap over + ] dip fib-step
  ] if
] ;

fib: ( n -- n ) [
  dup 2 < [ ] [
    0 1 <rot- fib-step
  ] if
] ;

30 fib .
25 fib .
